en/Bad Name.ftl: file names must start with a lowercase letter and use only a-z, 0-9, - and _
en/Bad Name.ftl:1: x: IDs in Bad Name.ftl must start with `Bad Name-`
en/app.ftl:2: review-title: IDs in app.ftl must start with `app-`
en/app.ftl:3: app-2fa: the part after `app-` must start with a letter
